    "name": "Einstein's Cats",
    "steam_appid": 2857980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Einstein\u2019s Cats</i> is a cozy single-player puzzle game based around verbal logic. \u201cBlack cats love tall boxes.\u201d \u201cJasper is not a white cat.\u201d \u201cCats wearing a bow hate being down low.\u201d Carefully read the clues, carefully evaluate your cats, and carefully place them into their preferred spots - in a cat bed, in a cardboard box, or into a plant pot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats. Black cats. White cats. Calico cats. Cats in hats. Cats in bows. Cats in hats with bows on them. If you ever, while playing this game, start to feel that there aren\u2019t enough cats, please take a moment and really think about it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ levels to enjoy, with varying levels of challenge and complexity! Relax in cozy greenhouses, cafes, and even outer space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming hand drawn art, in a paper-crafts style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely scrap-book to arrange and display all the stickers you collect throughout the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable on Steam Deck!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Perfect Scratching-Post For Your Brain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky, but not frustrating. One step at a time, the way all the clues mix and twist and interact; this kind of cat loves being next to that kind of cat\u2013 okay. That cat hates being next to the other kind of cat, which also likes being up high, but only in a short box. Okay. Carefully arrange the cats on the screen, one by one. Take your time. Take a breath. Take your little pat on the back when you finally get it\u2013 you\u2019ve earned that.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create &amp; Customize A Sticker-book With Unlockable Stickers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from twisting your brain into knots, and relax with your very own feline-themed sticker-book. As you complete chapters, you will unlock new stickers - cats, backgrounds, decorations, accessories, everything you need to create the perfect sticker-book page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get your thinking caps on: You'll want to keep playing to see what stickers will unlock next. Your cats will be very pleased with their new accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So Many Cats!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, really? Seriously? You still think there aren\u2019t enough cats in this game? And did you\u2013 oh. You sat and you thought about it? And even after sitting and thinking about it, you still don\u2019t think there are enough cats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huh. Well. Okay, then. Guess it needs some more cats. Here are some more cats. Better?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/87e3e45049c5d92c888d44e6a51d0a53.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Einstein\u2019s Cats</i> is a cozy single-player puzzle game based around verbal logic. \u201cBlack cats love tall boxes.\u201d \u201cJasper is not a white cat.\u201d \u201cCats wearing a bow hate being down low.\u201d Carefully read the clues, carefully evaluate your cats, and carefully place them into their preferred spots - in a cat bed, in a cardboard box, or into a plant pot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats. Black cats. White cats. Calico cats. Cats in hats. Cats in bows. Cats in hats with bows on them. If you ever, while playing this game, start to feel that there aren\u2019t enough cats, please take a moment and really think about it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ levels to enjoy, with varying levels of challenge and complexity! Relax in cozy greenhouses, cafes, and even outer space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming hand drawn art, in a paper-crafts style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely scrap-book to arrange and display all the stickers you collect throughout the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable on Steam Deck!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Perfect Scratching-Post For Your Brain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/08e1c1e04a5b3784281b0ede410009bf.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky, but not frustrating. One step at a time, the way all the clues mix and twist and interact; this kind of cat loves being next to that kind of cat\u2013 okay. That cat hates being next to the other kind of cat, which also likes being up high, but only in a short box. Okay. Carefully arrange the cats on the screen, one by one. Take your time. Take a breath. Take your little pat on the back when you finally get it\u2013 you\u2019ve earned that.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create &amp; Customize A Sticker-book With Unlockable Stickers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/9e571da91783167bce7c1a62c2c7714f.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from twisting your brain into knots, and relax with your very own feline-themed sticker-book. As you complete chapters, you will unlock new stickers - cats, backgrounds, decorations, accessories, everything you need to create the perfect sticker-book page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get your thinking caps on: You'll want to keep playing to see what stickers will unlock next. Your cats will be very pleased with their new accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So Many Cats!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.poster.avif?t=1750632503\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.webm?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857980/extras/6cdfb869e7eb99701d88bd6a9a8cc5a2.mp4?t=1750632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, really? Seriously? You still think there aren\u2019t enough cats in this game? And did you\u2013 oh. You sat and you thought about it? And even after sitting and thinking about it, you still don\u2019t think there are enough cats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huh. Well. Okay, then. Guess it needs some more cats. Here are some more cats. Better?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
